<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major></Major>
    <Description>Simple script for afk killer deranking

1. Bind script to key
2. Press icon "Starts as killer"
3. Press key to start key
4. Go make a tea:)

To turn off press key again </Description>
    <Comment>https://botmek.com - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>2</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>LeftDown 1
LeftUp 1
Delay 3 min
LeftDown 1
LeftUp 1
Delay 3 min
LeftDown 1
LeftUp 1
Delay 3 min</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Dead by daylight</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>